      "text": "Colombia tour – Bogotá, Medellín and Cartagena in 9 days"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:lead:e3456bc1f4d270f4",
      "field": "lead",
      "sourceTextSha256": "9ad691e1c92ba32b4595d5a68d3a974046394507a50ac42348e767886afdcb86",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-mw9gaoxq-fdhdlh",
        "model": "GPT-6.1"
      },
      "text": "This private itinerary takes you to three of Colombia’s main cities and several places beyond them. In Bogotá, explore the colonial centre, museums and Monserrate before visiting a coffee estate, Lake Guatavita and the underground Salt Cathedral of Zipaquirá. Fly to Medellín and head out to El Peñón de Guatapé. The trip ends in Cartagena, among fortress walls, old mansions and Caribbean architecture."
